{"content_hash": "f1322aa5d318cdfc", "version_id": 104, "article_id": 11, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Author Correction: Palladium Membrane Hydrogen Extraction Study", "title_zh": "作者更正：钯膜氢气提取研究", "topic": "science", "source": "nature", "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-11244-6", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51733627413_8ff72ca7da_b.jpg", "credit": "₡ґǘșϯγ Ɗᶏ Ⱪᶅṏⱳդ · cc0 1.0 · via flickr"}, "published_date": "2026-10-06", "word_count": 268, "reading_minutes": 1.3, "lead": "A correction has been issued for a Nature study on hydrogen extraction, originally published in September 2026. The fix involves a mislabeled bar in one of the figures.", "lead_zh": "《自然》杂志针对一项关于氢气提取的研究发布了更正，该研究最初于2026年9月发表。更正涉及图表中一个标注错误的柱状条。", "preview": "A correction has been published for a scientific article in the journal Nature. The original article, which was published on 9 September 202", "preview_zh": "《自然》杂志针对一篇科学文章发布了更正。该原文于2026年9月9日发表，标题为《阳极钯膜氢气提取增强热化学脱氢》。更正于2026年10月6日发布，内容涉及图表中的一个标注错误。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 94, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@9b040a2/content/audio/11/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 120.737, "size_bytes": 728208, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 311, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@9b040a2/content/data/versions/104.json", "paragraphs": ["A correction has been published for a scientific article in the journal Nature. The original article, which was published on 9 September 2026, was titled 'Anodic Pd membrane H2 extraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation'. The correction was published on 6 October 2026. It addresses a labeling mistake in one of the figures.", "According to the correction notice, the far-left bar in Figure 3c was originally labeled 'Pd-Ag under OCP'. However, this label was incorrect; it should have read 'Pd under OCP'. The authors have now fixed this error in both the HTML and PDF versions of the article. The correction ensures that the figure accurately represents the experimental data.", "The article was written by several researchers from the Massachusetts Institute of Technology (MIT). The authors include Rui Zeng, Julian Ufert, Bryan Y. Tang, Ryan P. Bisbey, and Yogesh Surendranath. Their work is associated with the Department of Chemistry and the Department of Chemical Engineering at MIT. The corresponding author for the paper is Yogesh Surendranath.", "The original study focused on a process called thermochemical dehydrogenation, which involves removing hydrogen from chemical compounds. The research explored how an anodic palladium membrane can be used to extract hydrogen, potentially improving the efficiency of the dehydrogenation process. Such research is relevant to fields like chemical engineering, electrocatalysis, and heterogeneous catalysis.", "Author corrections are common in scientific publishing and are used to fix errors that do not affect the main conclusions of a study. They help maintain the accuracy and integrity of the scientific record. This particular correction only involves a figure label and does not change the overall findings of the research."], "paragraphs_zh": ["《自然》杂志针对一篇科学文章发布了更正。该原文于2026年9月9日发表，标题为《阳极钯膜氢气提取增强热化学脱氢》。更正于2026年10月6日发布，内容涉及图表中的一个标注错误。", "根据更正通知，图3c中最左侧的柱状条原本标注为“OCP下的Pd-Ag”。然而，这个标注是错误的，应该改为“OCP下的Pd”。作者已经在文章的HTML和PDF版本中修正了这一错误。此次更正确保了图表能准确反映实验数据。", "这篇文章由麻省理工学院（MIT）的多位研究人员撰写。作者包括曾瑞、朱利安·乌费尔特、布莱恩·Y·唐、瑞安·P·比斯贝和约格什·苏伦德拉纳特。他们的工作隶属于麻省理工学院化学系和化学工程系。论文的通讯作者是约格什·苏伦德拉纳特。", "原始研究聚焦于一种称为热化学脱氢的过程，该过程涉及从化合物中去除氢。研究探索了如何利用阳极钯膜来提取氢气，从而可能提高脱氢过程的效率。这类研究与化学工程、电催化和多相催化等领域相关。", "作者更正在科学出版中很常见，用于修正不影响研究主要结论的错误。它们有助于维护科学记录的准确性和完整性。这次更正只涉及一个图表标签，不会改变研究的整体发现。"], "body": "A correction has been published for a scientific article in the journal Nature. The original article, which was published on 9 September 2026, was titled 'Anodic Pd membrane H2 extraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation'. The correction was published on 6 October 2026. It addresses a labeling mistake in one of the figures.\n\nAccording to the correction notice, the far-left bar in Figure 3c was originally labeled 'Pd-Ag under OCP'. However, this label was incorrect; it should have read 'Pd under OCP'. The authors have now fixed this error in both the HTML and PDF versions of the article. The correction ensures that the figure accurately represents the experimental data.\n\nThe article was written by several researchers from the Massachusetts Institute of Technology (MIT). The authors include Rui Zeng, Julian Ufert, Bryan Y. Tang, Ryan P. Bisbey, and Yogesh Surendranath. Their work is associated with the Department of Chemistry and the Department of Chemical Engineering at MIT. The corresponding author for the paper is Yogesh Surendranath.\n\nThe original study focused on a process called thermochemical dehydrogenation, which involves removing hydrogen from chemical compounds. The research explored how an anodic palladium membrane can be used to extract hydrogen, potentially improving the efficiency of the dehydrogenation process. Such research is relevant to fields like chemical engineering, electrocatalysis, and heterogeneous catalysis.\n\nAuthor corrections are common in scientific publishing and are used to fix errors that do not affect the main conclusions of a study. They help maintain the accuracy and integrity of the scientific record. This particular correction only involves a figure label and does not change the overall findings of the research.", "body_zh": "《自然》杂志针对一篇科学文章发布了更正。该原文于2026年9月9日发表，标题为《阳极钯膜氢气提取增强热化学脱氢》。更正于2026年10月6日发布，内容涉及图表中的一个标注错误。\n\n根据更正通知，图3c中最左侧的柱状条原本标注为“OCP下的Pd-Ag”。然而，这个标注是错误的，应该改为“OCP下的Pd”。作者已经在文章的HTML和PDF版本中修正了这一错误。此次更正确保了图表能准确反映实验数据。\n\n这篇文章由麻省理工学院（MIT）的多位研究人员撰写。作者包括曾瑞、朱利安·乌费尔特、布莱恩·Y·唐、瑞安·P·比斯贝和约格什·苏伦德拉纳特。他们的工作隶属于麻省理工学院化学系和化学工程系。论文的通讯作者是约格什·苏伦德拉纳特。\n\n原始研究聚焦于一种称为热化学脱氢的过程，该过程涉及从化合物中去除氢。研究探索了如何利用阳极钯膜来提取氢气，从而可能提高脱氢过程的效率。这类研究与化学工程、电催化和多相催化等领域相关。\n\n作者更正在科学出版中很常见，用于修正不影响研究主要结论的错误。它们有助于维护科学记录的准确性和完整性。这次更正只涉及一个图表标签，不会改变研究的整体发现。", "text": "A correction has been published for a scientific article in the journal Nature. The original article, which was published on 9 September 2026, was titled 'Anodic Pd membrane H2 extraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation'. The correction was published on 6 October 2026. It addresses a labeling mistake in one of the figures. According to the correction notice, the far-left bar in Figure 3c was originally labeled 'Pd-Ag under OCP'. However, this label was incorrect; it should have read 'Pd under OCP'. The authors have now fixed this error in both the HTML and PDF versions of the article. The correction ensures that the figure accurately represents the experimental data. The article was written by several researchers from the Massachusetts Institute of Technology (MIT). The authors include Rui Zeng, Julian Ufert, Bryan Y. Tang, Ryan P. Bisbey, and Yogesh Surendranath. Their work is associated with the Department of Chemistry and the Department of Chemical Engineering at MIT. The corresponding author for the paper is Yogesh Surendranath. The original study focused on a process called thermochemical dehydrogenation, which involves removing hydrogen from chemical compounds. The research explored how an anodic palladium membrane can be used to extract hydrogen, potentially improving the efficiency of the dehydrogenation process. Such research is relevant to fields like chemical engineering, electrocatalysis, and heterogeneous catalysis. Author corrections are common in scientific publishing and are used to fix errors that do not affect the main conclusions of a study. They help maintain the accuracy and integrity of the scientific record. This particular correction only involves a figure label and does not change the overall findings of the research.", "vocab": [{"word": "correction", "pos": "noun", "zh": "更正，修正", "note": "指对已发布内容的错误进行修正，常用于学术出版。"}, {"word": "membrane", "pos": "noun", "zh": "膜", "note": "在化学中常指用于分离物质的薄层材料。"}, {"word": "extraction", "pos": "noun", "zh": "提取，萃取", "note": "指从混合物中分离出某种物质的过程。"}, {"word": "dehydrogenation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "脱氢", "note": "化学术语，指从分子中移除氢原子。"}, {"word": "label", "pos": "verb", "zh": "标注，贴标签", "note": "此处指在图表或物体上添加说明文字。"}, {"word": "figure", "pos": "noun", "zh": "图表，插图", "note": "学术论文中的图表，常用Figure加数字表示。"}, {"word": "anodic", "pos": "adj", "zh": "阳极的", "note": "与电化学中的阳极相关。"}, {"word": "thermochemical", "pos": "adj", "zh": "热化学的", "note": "涉及热和化学反应的。"}, {"word": "corresponding author", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "通讯作者", "note": "学术论文中负责联系和回复的主要作者。"}, {"word": "electrocatalysis", "pos": "noun", "zh": "电催化", "note": "利用电极材料加速化学反应的过程。"}, {"word": "heterogeneous catalysis", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "多相催化", "note": "催化剂与反应物处于不同相态的催化过程。"}, {"word": "integrity", "pos": "noun", "zh": "完整性，诚信", "note": "此处指科学记录的准确和可靠。"}], "title_original": "Author Correction: Anodic Pd membrane H<sub>2</sub> extraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation", "summary_original": "Nature, Published online: 06 October 2026;\ndoi:10.1038/s41586-026-11244-6\nAuthor Correction: Anodic Pd membrane H\n2\nextraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation", "body_original": "Download PDF\nAuthor Correction\nPublished:\n06 October 2026\nAuthor Correction: Anodic Pd membrane H\n2\nextraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation\nRui Zeng\n(\n曾瑞\n)\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0002-7577-767X\n1\n,\nJulian Ufert\nORCID:\norcid.org/0009-0004-6031-5773\n2\n,\nBryan Y. Tang\n1\n,\nRyan P. Bisbey\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0001-8699-5077\n1\n&\n…\nYogesh Surendranath\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0003-1016-3420\n1\n,\n2\nShow authors\nNature\n(\n2026\n)\nCite this article\nSave article\nView saved research\nThe\nOriginal Article\nwas published on 09 September 2026\nExplore related subjects\nDiscover the latest articles and news in related subjects.\nChemical engineering\nElectrocatalysis\nHeterogeneous cataly